<![CDATA[<span id="docs-internal-guid-f4cc0db8-c6e0-7746-7d1a-66d80502b989"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">{!Contact.FirstName},</span></p><br><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Thank you for your interest in the family and human development online master’s program. </span><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Please review the </span><a href="https://thesanfordschool.asu.edu/sites/default/files/Handbook-FHD-Online-MS3_12_2014.pdf" style="line-height: 1.15; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: none;"><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); text-decoration: underline; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">program handbook</span></a><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> for information on the admission process, required courses, program timeline, capstone project and more.</span></p><br><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Applications are accepted on a rolling basis for entry in fall, spring or summer semesters. The application deadlines by semester can be found </span><a href="https://thesanfordschool.asu.edu/fhd-ms-online/admissions" style="text-decoration:none;"><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); text-decoration: underline; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">online</span></a><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">. </span><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Be sure to bookmark this page and check back regularly for updates.</span></p><br><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Once you have reviewed the handbook, please email </span><a href="mailto:gina.perez@asu.edu" style="text-decoration:none;"><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); text-decoration: underline; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">me</span></a><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> with any questions you may have.</span></p><br><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><a href="https://webapp4.asu.edu/dgsadmissions/Index.jsp" style="text-decoration:none;"><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); text-decoration: underline; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Start your application today</span></a><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">.</span></p><br><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Thank you and we look forward to hearing from you!</span></p><br><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Gina Perez</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Graduate Programs Coordinator</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">T. Denny Sanford School of Social and Family Dynamics</span></p><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">480-965-6874</span></span>]]></td>
</tr>
